        <p>Search "arborist Boise" and you'll get two very different kinds of results: certified tree care professionals who studied tree biology for years, and companies that put "arborist" in their name because it sounds better than "guy with a chainsaw." From the curb, their trucks look identical. Three years after they prune your maple, the difference is obvious.</p>

        <p>This page explains what an arborist actually is, when hiring one matters (and when it honestly doesn't), what arborist services cost in Boise, and how to verify anyone's credentials in about two minutes — including ours.</p>

        <!-- Table of Contents -->
        <div class="toc">
          <strong style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;color:#1A531A;">In this article:</strong>
          <ul style="margin-top:12px;">
